# Exemplos de Requisições para a API de Banco

### Depósito

POST http://localhost:3000/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "alextavella",
  "amount": 100
}

### Saque

POST http://localhost:3000/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "alextavella",
  "amount": 50
}

### Consulta de Saldo

GET http://localhost:3000/balance/alextavella

